{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52567","headline":"北邙古墓 · 宋之问","name":"北邙古墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见邙山苑外上宫坟，相接累累萦蔓草。\n宫亭远识南宫树，逶迤辗作南宫道。\n一朝形影化穷尘，昔时玉貌与朱唇。\n锦衾香覆青楼月，罗衣娇弄紫台云。\n越娃楚艳君不见，赵舞燕歌愁杀人。\n游鼙倐掩寂无晤，蛾眉何事须相妬。\n九重见日闭鸳鸯，三泉今夕开狐兔。\n驻马倚车望洛阳，御桥天阙遥相当。\n佳人死别无归日，可怜行路尽沾衣。\n（同前第二一八八页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}